{
  "schema": "scitex-notebook-path-vectors/1",
  "about": [
    "Conformance vectors for 'which notebook is this Jupyter kernel executing?'.",
    "This file and run_notebook_vectors.py next to it are BYTE-IDENTICAL in",
    "scitex-io (tests/scitex_io/conformance/, run against",
    "scitex_io._notebook.resolve_notebook, which routes save() to <notebook>_out/)",
    "and scitex-session (tests/scitex_session/conformance/, run against",
    "scitex_session._lifecycle._notebook.resolve_notebook, which anchors @session).",
    "A change to the resolution rule must update BOTH implementations and THESE",
    "FILES IN BOTH REPOSITORIES in the same change.",
    "",
    "Order (first match wins): env ($SCITEX_NOTEBOOK_PATH) > vscode",
    "(__vsc_ipynb_file__) > jupyter (__session__, then $JPY_SESSION_NAME) >",
    "parent-cmdline (a .ipynb argument of the launching process, relative to ITS",
    "cwd, accepted only if one of its code cells equals the running cell) >",
    "jupyter-server (scitex_context.get_notebook_path; never resolves here).",
    "",
    "Each case runs in a REAL IPython shell: the runner executes probe_cell, whose",
    "call to the resolver sees the case's user namespace and environment. Every",
    "path is relative to a fresh sandbox directory S; '{S}' in a value is replaced",
    "by S's absolute path. Fields:",
    "  notebooks  {path: [cells]}: a string is a code cell ('PROBE' = probe_cell),",
    "             an object {cell_type, source} is any other cell",
    "  files      other (empty) files to create",
    "  cwd        the kernel's working directory (default '.')",
    "  env        environment the resolver sees (JPY_PARENT_PID is set by the",
    "             runner to the launcher's pid)",
    "  user_ns    variables in the kernel's user namespace",
    "  launcher   {argv, cwd}: a real process is started with these extra",
    "             arguments in that directory and plays the kernel's launcher",
    "             (default: no arguments, cwd '.')",
    "  expect     {path, source} with path relative to S, or {path: null}"
  ],
  "probe_cell": "__vector_result__ = __vector_resolve__()",
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "env-wins-over-everything",
      "notebooks": {"a/x.ipynb": ["PROBE"], "b/y.ipynb": ["PROBE"], "c/z.ipynb": ["PROBE"]},
      "env": {"SCITEX_NOTEBOOK_PATH": "{S}/a/x.ipynb", "JPY_SESSION_NAME": "{S}/b/y.ipynb"},
      "user_ns": {"__vsc_ipynb_file__": "{S}/b/y.ipynb", "__session__": "{S}/b/y.ipynb"},
      "launcher": {"argv": ["c/z.ipynb"], "cwd": "."},
      "expect": {"path": "a/x.ipynb", "source": "env"}
    },
    {
      "id": "env-relative-to-kernel-cwd",
      "notebooks": {"a/x.ipynb": ["x = 1"]},
      "cwd": "a",
      "env": {"SCITEX_NOTEBOOK_PATH": "x.ipynb"},
      "expect": {"path": "a/x.ipynb", "source": "env"}
    },
    {
      "id": "env-not-an-ipynb-is-ignored",
      "notebooks": {"b/y.ipynb": ["x = 1"]},
      "files": ["a/x.txt"],
      "env": {"SCITEX_NOTEBOOK_PATH": "{S}/a/x.txt"},
      "user_ns": {"__vsc_ipynb_file__": "{S}/b/y.ipynb"},
      "expect": {"path": "b/y.ipynb", "source": "vscode"}
    },
    {
      "id": "env-missing-file-falls-through-to-launcher",
      "notebooks": {"nb/e.ipynb": ["PROBE"]},
      "env": {"SCITEX_NOTEBOOK_PATH": "{S}/nb/missing.ipynb"},
      "launcher": {"argv": ["--execute", "nb/e.ipynb"], "cwd": "."},
      "expect": {"path": "nb/e.ipynb", "source": "parent-cmdline"}
    },
    {
      "id": "vscode-wins-over-jupyter",
      "notebooks": {"a/x.ipynb": ["x = 1"], "b/y.ipynb": ["x = 1"]},
      "user_ns": {"__vsc_ipynb_file__": "{S}/a/x.ipynb", "__session__": "{S}/b/y.ipynb"},
      "expect": {"path": "a/x.ipynb", "source": "vscode"}
    },
    {
      "id": "vscode-missing-file-falls-through-to-jupyter",
      "notebooks": {"b/y.ipynb": ["x = 1"]},
      "user_ns": {"__vsc_ipynb_file__": "{S}/a/gone.ipynb", "__session__": "{S}/b/y.ipynb"},
      "expect": {"path": "b/y.ipynb", "source": "jupyter"}
    },
    {
      "id": "session-global-wins-over-jpy-session-name",
      "notebooks": {"a/x.ipynb": ["x = 1"], "b/y.ipynb": ["x = 1"]},
      "env": {"JPY_SESSION_NAME": "{S}/b/y.ipynb"},
      "user_ns": {"__session__": "{S}/a/x.ipynb"},
      "expect": {"path": "a/x.ipynb", "source": "jupyter"}
    },
    {
      "id": "jpy-session-name-absolute",
      "notebooks": {"a/x.ipynb": ["x = 1"]},
      "env": {"JPY_SESSION_NAME": "{S}/a/x.ipynb"},
      "expect": {"path": "a/x.ipynb", "source": "jupyter"}
    },
    {
      "id": "jpy-session-name-relative-to-server-root-found-in-kernel-cwd",
      "notebooks": {"root/sub/x.ipynb": ["x = 1"]},
      "cwd": "root/sub",
      "env": {"JPY_SESSION_NAME": "sub/x.ipynb"},
      "expect": {"path": "root/sub/x.ipynb", "source": "jupyter"}
    },
    {
      "id": "launcher-ipynb-relative-to-launcher-cwd",
      "notebooks": {"proj/nb/e.ipynb": ["import os", "PROBE"]},
      "cwd": "proj/nb",
      "launcher": {"argv": ["--to", "notebook", "--execute", "nb/e.ipynb"], "cwd": "proj"},
      "expect": {"path": "proj/nb/e.ipynb", "source": "parent-cmdline"}
    },
    {
      "id": "launcher-ipynb-without-the-running-cell-is-rejected",
      "notebooks": {"nb/other.ipynb": ["x = 1"]},
      "launcher": {"argv": ["nb/other.ipynb"], "cwd": "."},
      "expect": {"path": null}
    },
    {
      "id": "launcher-ipynb-with-the-cell-only-in-markdown-is-rejected",
      "notebooks": {"nb/md.ipynb": [{"cell_type": "markdown", "source": "__vector_result__ = __vector_resolve__()"}]},
      "launcher": {"argv": ["nb/md.ipynb"], "cwd": "."},
      "expect": {"path": null}
    },
    {
      "id": "launcher-first-ipynb-holding-the-cell-wins",
      "notebooks": {"in.ipynb": ["x = 1"], "run.ipynb": ["PROBE"], "out.ipynb": ["PROBE"]},
      "launcher": {"argv": ["in.ipynb", "run.ipynb", "out.ipynb"], "cwd": "."},
      "expect": {"path": "run.ipynb", "source": "parent-cmdline"}
    },
    {
      "id": "nothing-names-a-notebook",
      "notebooks": {"nb/e.ipynb": ["PROBE"]},
      "cwd": "nb",
      "expect": {"path": null}
    }
  ]
}
